stateDiagram-v2
    direction LR
    [*] --> CLOSED
    CLOSED --> LISTEN: listen()
    CLOSED --> SYN_SENT: connect()<br/>(send SYN)

    LISTEN --> SYN_RCVD: SYN<br/>(send SYN-ACK)
    SYN_RCVD --> ESTABLISHED: ACK
    SYN_SENT --> ESTABLISHED: SYN-ACK<br/>(send ACK)

    ESTABLISHED --> FIN_WAIT_1: close()<br/>(send FIN)
    ESTABLISHED --> CLOSE_WAIT: FIN<br/>(send ACK)

    FIN_WAIT_1 --> FIN_WAIT_2: ACK
    FIN_WAIT_1 --> CLOSING: FIN<br/>(send ACK)
    FIN_WAIT_2 --> TIME_WAIT: FIN<br/>(send ACK)
    CLOSING --> TIME_WAIT: ACK
    TIME_WAIT --> CLOSED: 2MSL timer

    CLOSE_WAIT --> LAST_ACK: close()<br/>(send FIN)
    LAST_ACK --> CLOSED: ACK
